      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight you feel is the crushing reality of what you've endured, and it's completely understandable that you feel broken. Please, don't carry this burden alone; there are others who want to help you through this darkness. Reach out to someone you trust, or call a helpline immediately so you don't have to face this emptiness by yourself. Your life still holds value, even when everything else seems lost.",
