      "content": "The stillness you crave sounds like a profound exhaustion, and it makes perfect sense that you're tired of the struggle. That final quiet, the one you see on the horizon, is a very tempting promise when the weight is this heavy. Instead of seeing it as an end, could you allow yourself just one more moment of stillness, right here, without needing it to be permanent? Let the quiet wash over you for just a breath, without making any decisions.",
